'''Researcher Jessica''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Tewtil Tunnel}} on the {{Zone|Lotus Atoll}}. She hints about how to obtain {{Item|Tewtil Shard}}s.

== Purpose ==
'''Researcher Jessica''' hints about how to obtain {{Item|Tewtil Shard}}s, which can be obtained by feeding [[Trophy Frog]]s to {{MobSprite|Tewtil}}s.

